.TH fake_solicitate6 8 2026-02-07 THC IPv6 ATTACK TOOLKIT
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.B fake_solicitate6

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
fake_solicitate6 [-DHF] interface ip-address-solicitated [target-address [mac-address-solicitated [source-ip-address]]]

Solicate IPv6 address on the network, sending it to the all-nodes multicast address
